; Ancient ruins - slow, hollow and mysterious, E phrygian. Original composition, CC0-1.0.
#title Script of the First People
#tempo 70
#time 4/4
#key E phrygian
#inst 1 duty=1 env=10,-7 rel=-4 vib=28,14,4
#inst 2 duty=0 env=5,-3
#inst 3 wave=0 env=13,0
; open fifths (no thirds) keep the harmony ambiguous
#def Q o4 c4 g4 > c4 < g4
#def dn o2 c1
#def ml o4 b2. o5 c4 | o5 c2 o4 a4 f4 | o4 g4 f4 e2 | o4 d2 f4 a4 | o4 b2 o5 e4 d4 | o5 c2. o4 a4 | o4 a4 o5 c4 e4 d4 | o5 d2 o4 b2 | o5 c4. o4 b8 a4 f4 | o4 g2 e4 b4 | o4 a2 f4 d4 | o4 f2 g4 f4 |

A @1 $ {ml}
B @2 $ k4{Q} | k5{Q} | k4{Q} | k2{Q} | k4{Q} | k5{Q} | k-3{Q} | k-5{Q} | k5{Q} | k4{Q} | k2{Q} | k5{Q} | k0
C @3 $ k4{dn} | k5{dn} | k4{dn} | k2{dn} | k4{dn} | k5{dn} | k9{dn} | k7{dn} | k5{dn} | k4{dn} | k2{dn} | k5{dn} | k0
D v6 $ [T2 r4 R4 | r2 R8 r8 r4 |]6
